 - 2026-06-27: PHASE A1b (ARC NORTH STAR; INDUCER-CEILING A/B) -- Family-B REFERENCE vs LOCAL open-code inducer. Gated on A1's value-gap-NOT-closed regime (tta_changed_cell_value_accuracy_delta_median < 0.1). Run ONE Family-B reference-inducer lane and ONE local-open-code lane against the SAME held-out graded transition gate as A1, to attribute the residual: is the LOCAL Qwen3.5-9B the ceiling (a stronger inducer would close the value gap) or is the METHOD the ceiling (even a reference inducer overfits the observed prefix)? (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete_inducer_ceiling_neither_lane_lifts_method_is_ceiling; results/experiment_4883_inducer_ceiling_ab.json
